00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.130
How wonderful...

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:13.390
How gorgeous!

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.200
And then...

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:15.500
Outta my way!
And then...

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.400
Outta my way!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.500
Sorry, sonny.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.500
Come back here!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.200
Old bastard!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:21.600
Screw you!
Old bastard!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.440
Screw you!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.370
Why you!

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.070
All right!

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.750
Here gramps, let me give you a hand.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.890
Oh, thanks.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.600
Stephan! Stephan, wake up!

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:55.970
Y-Yuri.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.940
Thank goodness. Are you all right?

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:01.000
That was nothing.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.370
Stephan...

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.810
Oh, sorry again, sonny.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.620
They're all knocked out.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.080
Including Stephan.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.010
Huh?

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.950
Who needs a goofy-looking
guy like that anyway, right?

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:17.460
You're pretty good, missy.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.860
You too, gramps.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.560
You think so?

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.490
By the way...

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:27.290
I hear a couple of girls from the 3WA are staying
at this hotel. Any idea where I can find them?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:34.970
Dig Here, Meow Meow
Happiness Comes at the End

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.970
So you two are the Dirty Pair!

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.520
Lovely Angels!
Lovely Angels!

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.520
Oh, right, right.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.920
The Dirty Angels.

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.110
Lovely!
Lovely!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.910
I know, I know. No need to badger me.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:56.300
So, let's hear it. Why do you want to
hire us for some unofficial job?

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.030
We're on vacation, you know.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.190
Well, the truth is...

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.100
The truth is?

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:06.670
You two are real cuties.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.310
It was a joke, a joke.

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.840
Don't make me angry.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.280
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.890
Actually, I'm on a treasure hunt.

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:17.850
Huh?
Huh?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:21.190
Do you know about the La Kahanga?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.790
They're the people who used to
live on Planet Yukka, right?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:28.630
They were a highly advanced civilization,
but they all died out, didn't they?

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.100
That's right.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:34.070
But when I was young,
I accidentally discovered a key...

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:37.710
...which can open the door that
guards La Kahanga's hidden treasure.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.310
The key to their treasure?

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:42.180
Gramps, you can read
those strange characters?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.200
Yeah. It took me all these years,
but I was finally able to decipher it.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:52.720
However, as soon as I figured out the vault's
secret location, Clementine betrayed me.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.790
Clementine?
Clementine?

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.190
The woman who once loved me...

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:56.960
Huh?
Huh?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:58.590
Just kidding!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.990
She was my assistant these past five years.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.970
So she's the one who sent
those hoodlums earlier?

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:06.300
Indeed.
So she's the one who sent
those hoodlums earlier?

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:06.840
Indeed.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:11.640
That's where you come in. Will you
protect me and help find the treasure?

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:18.110
It's a treasure trove of silver and gold,
worth at least 150 million credits.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.580
150 million credits?!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.590
What's our share?

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.550
Wait, you actually want to take the job?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:25.690
Of course. So how much?
Wait, you actually want to take the job?

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.120
Of course. So how much?

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:27.390
Of course. So how much?
Ten percent of the treasure.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.590
Ten percent of the treasure.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:28.820
All right.
Ten percent of the treasure.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:29.320
All right.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:29.790
All right.
Hey.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:30.290
Hey.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.930
What? You don't want to?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.900
No. I think we should...

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.730
...get twenty percent!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.530
Greedy.
...get twenty percent!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.290
B-But...

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.870
Don't be stingy.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.130
It's settled, then!

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.080
I'm not paying twenty percent.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.510
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.310
Shall we go, then?

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.900
Let's go find some treasure.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.510
Here it comes.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:18.810
It's no use! The lock's broken!

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:20.630
Can't you shoot it open?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.040
What's our share, gramps?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:25.050
This is no time to talk about that!

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.310
Twenty percent.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:29.950
Our share?

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.490
Our share?!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.980
Twenty percent, twenty-five percent,
whatever! Just save me!

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.860
You've got yourself a deal.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.930
Here, let me open the door for you.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:49.000
Come on, let's go treasure hunting!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.030
Twenty percent, okay?

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.810
Kids these days...

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.220
Useless idiots.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:01.010
Go.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.430
Fifteen million credits each!

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:17.870
I'm going to quit my job and party every day!

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.760
You could thank me for negotiating it
to twenty percent, you know.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.710
Okay, okay.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.700
You did great and I really appreciate it.

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.500
H-Hey, what's that smell?

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.710
What are you doing, gramps?

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:33.980
I'm cooking.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.450
Cooking?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.050
I'm making a special dish
that'll give us lots of stamina.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.380
Is that what I think it is?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.590
G-Garlic?

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.330
That's right.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.100
Jeez, why?

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.960
No, I can't bear it anymore!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:55.800
We need to give ourselves a stamina boost.
After all, my long-time dream is about to come true.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:59.070
I've spent my entire life chasing this dream!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.980
He sounds like a kid who never grew up.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.170
I guess we'll let it slide this time...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.850
Then again, maybe not!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.610
No way!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.780
Ah, Nanmo's scent sensor is!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:19.560
Nanmo, pull yourself together!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.660
I'll try and pull us up somehow.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:22.960
I'm counting on you.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.200
It's no good, I can't control it!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.330
Keep trying, Kei!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.300
I'm doing the best I can!

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.200
We're falling, we're falling!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.480
You have to do something!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:35.780
I know!
You have to do something!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:36.440
I know!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.520
Are you all right, Nanmo?

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:55.590
Can you fix yourself?

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:01.640
Who would have guessed Nanmo's
scent senor can't handle garlic?

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.330
It's like a little vampire.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:06.810
Guess I caused you guys some trouble?

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:10.210
Jeez, you still stink of garlic.
Be careful, okay?

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.180
Mughi, we're counting on you
to fix Nanmo, okay?

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.680
Well then, let's get to
the treasure before they do.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.490
Off we go!
Off we go!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.350
Not much longer 'til we find the treasure!

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:51.620
I can't wait!
Not much longer 'til we find the treasure!

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:52.420
I can't wait!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.590
What the hell?

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:55.020
Don't stop so suddenly.
What the hell?

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.490
Don't stop so suddenly.

00:09:57.560 --> 00:10:01.220
I-I'm finally here.
I finally made it all the way here!

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.770
This is it, this is it, this is it!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:17.840
We can enter the underground caverns
from beneath this deity statue.

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:21.540
Fifteen million credits each!

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.120
Hey, keep moving.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.530
Well, I would, but...

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.400
Get out.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.950
You've caused us a lot of trouble.
But now it's the end for you.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.010
Underhanded bitch.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:55.050
You're terrible for stealing
other people's treasure.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.180
Shut up!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:59.790
I had to put up with the stench of garlic
for five long years as his assistant!

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.390
I can sort of understand how she feels.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.120
Yeah.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.260
I'll be taking this.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.390
Go stand by the wall.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:09.230
Now!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.760
Ugh, the garlic stench...

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.860
I know this temple a lot
better than Clementine does.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.330
Ah, my hair's all dusty.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:15.260
You don't need that key anymore
since we opened that door, right?

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:19.030
No, the actual door to the treasure
is deep within this cavern.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.610
Hmm, luminous rocks, huh?

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:32.770
The La Kahanga were
amazing people, weren't they?

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.190
W-What's that?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.480
Gross!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.620
W-What are we supposed to do?

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.120
A-Are you all right, gramps?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.870
That's pretty violent for someone
who was screaming like a little girl.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.500
Well, I was scared!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:16.120
That was Clementine!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:25.270
What?! You're still alive?

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:27.290
I'm not gonna die until I see that treasure!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:39.510
You've got to be kidding me!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:44.050
I've never seen a monster like that before!

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.400
It was just a hologram.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.940
That just goes to show how advanced
La Kahanga technology was.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.100
Okay, Clementine.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.370
Give me back the key.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:09.770
Guess I have no choice.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.610
What are you doing?!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.450
Jeez, that woman!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.860
The treasure is mine.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.700
No fair!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.430
Heartless witch!
No fair!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.360
Heartless witch!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.740
I thought you knew this place
better than she did.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.710
I forgot about the trap door.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:41.630
Good grief.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.670
Blast the ceiling with your weapon.

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:48.280
It's out of power from the last fight.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:52.720
Traps like this usually
have a switch somewhere.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:14.510
Is it just me, or is the ceiling getting closer?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:18.040
Oh, come on. That would be
too cliché, don't you think?

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.140
Another trap!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:27.510
It's okay. This is probably just a hologram,
like all the other La Kahanga-

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.780
Or not.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.360
I know! Call Mughi and Nanmo.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:37.330
Right!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.860
It can't get through.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:46.440
There's a jamming signal
coming from somewhere.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.340
It's another one of the La Kahanga's traps.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.000
Wow, what great technolo-
Wow, what great technolo-

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.160
We shouldn't have been so greedy.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:07.160
I'd rather be hanging out with that wimp
Stephan and getting a room full of roses.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.790
Roses? You poor girls.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.750
I guess this is the end?

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.720
I can't believe I have to die smelling garlic,
and without ever seeing the treasure.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:35.520
I'm sorry I dragged you two into this.

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:38.430
And I'm sorry that we couldn't make
your life-long dream come true.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:38.590
It's okay.
And I'm sorry that we couldn't make
your life-long dream come true.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:39.690
It's okay.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:40.730
Gramps.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:41.990
Gramps...

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:19.170
We're saved, we're saved!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.530
Mughi!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.240
Ah, thank you, thank you!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.160
Thanks, thanks!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.300
Thank you so much! Thank you so much!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:36.850
Mughi, fix it again, please.

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.890
Hey, gramps.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:46.660
Even if we make it to the vault, don't you think
Clementine will have already taken the treasure?

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:53.120
Nope. Clementine doesn't know this, but it takes
more than one person to open the vault door.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.610
I was right. The door hasn't been opened yet.

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.450
So, in that room...

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:14.180
Yes. The treasure, worth at least
150 million credits, lies beyond this door.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:18.190
That's...

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.930
That key is useless.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.700
Can't you tell by looking at me?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.030
Clementine!

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:27.640
Serves you right!

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:27.970
That's what you get!
Serves you right!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:28.800
That's what you get!

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.440
Just you watch, Clementine.

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:35.980
All right.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:38.510
Yuri, you stand there.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.780
Kei, you stand over there.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:41.320
O-Okay.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:42.110
Sure.
O-Okay.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.280
Push! Push it down!

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:57.860
Eh? What is this?

